transfer falls within an exception in Rule 501(a)
=================================================

4 ways this can be satisfied.

  1. transfer's is to the issuer of the securities
  2. transfer's is to an accredited investor
  3. transfer's is as part of an offering registered with the Commission
  4. transfer's is to a member of the family of the purchaser or the equivalent, to a trust controlled by the purchaser, to a trust created for the benefit of a member of the family of the purchaser or the equivalent, or in connection with the death or divorce of the purchaser or other similar circumstance
